+        // cleared, MSR[IP] is unchanged so the vector prefix does not move, and
+        // MSR[LE] is copied from MSR[ILE] - bit 15, so `>> 16` onto bit 31.
+        // MSR[ME] is unchanged except on a machine check, where it is cleared so
+        // that a nested machine check checkstops instead of looping.
